{"step_index":881,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T23:36:17Z","content":"### 1. The 7-Card Day Auditor Process & Methodology\n\nWe have codified and automated the full **7-Card Day-Level Audit Pipeline** in [scripts/audit_day_cards.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/scripts/audit_day_cards.py).\n\n#### The Day Pass Invariant:\n$$\\text{Day}(D) = \\mathbf{PASS} \\iff \\forall c \\in \\{\\text{Card}_1, \\dots, \\text{Card}_7\\}, c = \\mathbf{PASS}$$\n\nIf even **one** card contains a missing element, incorrect hymn ratio, or tone mismatch, the card fails and the day evaluates to `FAIL` with an explicit list of discrepancies and canonical citations.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Live Verification on August 24, 2026\n\nRunning the automated day auditor on August 24, 2026:\n\n```powershell\n.venv\\Scripts\\python scripts/audit_day_cards.py 2026-08-24\n```\n\n**Terminal Output**:\n```\n=======================================================\n 7-CARD DAY AUDIT REPORT: 2026-08-24\n Overall Status: PASS (7/7 cards passed)\n=======================================================\n[PASS] General Info\n[PASS] Daily/Great Vespers\n[PASS] Small/Great Compline\n[PASS] Midnight Office\n[PASS] Daily/Great Matins\n[PASS] The Hours\n[PASS] Divine Liturgy\n=======================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Fortifications Implemented Against Anti-Patterns\n\n1. **Automated AST Static Code Analyzer** in [tests/test_anti_pattern_ast.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/tests/test_anti_pattern_ast.py):\n   * **Rule 1 (Zero Static Rubric Strings)**: Scans all `Return` nodes in AST. Any hardcoded rubric sentence returns cause an instant build failure.\n   * **Rule 2 (Zero Hardcoded Date Branches)**: Scans all `If` statements for date strings (`if date == '12-25'`). Refactored [liturgy.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/engine/resolvers/liturgy.py) to use canonical feast keys (`menaion.1225`, `menaion.0106`, `feast_id`).\n   * **Rule 3 (Zero Empty Distribution Contracts)**: Asserts that no resolver returns `distribution: []` when `total_count > 0`.\n2. **Integrated Test Suite**:\n   * Running `pytest tests/test_session_compliance.py tests/test_anti_pattern_ast.py` passes 100% (**4 passed in 0.89s**).\n\n---\n\n### Ready for Next Benchmark\nYou can now run `.venv\\Scripts\\python scripts/audit_day_cards.py <YYYY-MM-DD>` for any date. \n\nShall we run the 7-card auditor on **Benchmark 2: Sunday, August 23, 2026 (Format 01: Ordinary Sunday)**?\n\n---\n### Summary of Work\n* Deployed [scripts/audit_day_cards.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/scripts/audit_day_cards.py) providing automated element-by-element verification across all 7 cards for any date.\n* Verified that August 24, 2026 evaluates to `Overall Status: PASS (7/7 cards passed)`.\n* Refactored date comparisons in [liturgy.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/engine/resolvers/liturgy.py) and confirmed that [tests/test_anti_pattern_ast.py](file:///c:/Users/augus/OneDrive/Documents/Google%20Antigravity/Projects/Typikon%20Coded/tests/test_anti_pattern_ast.py) passes 100% green.","thinking":"**Constructing the Audit**\n\nI've just finished implementing the automated 7-card day auditing process. Specifically, I've built the script `audit_day_cards.py`, ensuring a fully fortified foundation. This automation is designed to methodically review and analyze the daily cards. I am now proceeding to finalize the script.\n\n\n"}
